Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.35,0:00:03.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.75,0:00:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在已经难辨真假了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having a difficult time figuring out what's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:07.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你从未离开过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never left Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.27,0:00:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是和我一起在笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are still in the cage with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看下你手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:11.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你受伤的时候我跟你在一起  我给你缝的针\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was with you when you cut it, I sewed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:12.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.65,0:00:15.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许我是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might be a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.26,0:00:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我能控制得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm managing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:18.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-镇上有活干  -尸体在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There was a job in town. - Where's the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.77,0:00:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let her go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你了解我  你知道我是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me. You know the kind of person I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在杀人  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dropping bodies, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:25.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们就得杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means we got to drop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.91,0:00:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了救我她杀了她母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed her own mom to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  但事情就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but it's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.19,0:00:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:31.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:36.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:38.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你改不了你的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还会再杀人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will kill again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.49,0:00:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.51,0:00:52.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(密歇根州  迪尔伯恩)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.63,0:01:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.99,0:01:44.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.99,0:01:45.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.71,0:01:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.17,0:01:59.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:02:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第7季第4集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:10.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.59,0:02:17.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.75,0:02:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉好怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels wonky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.53,0:02:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做这种常规的活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working a regular job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果利维坦那边出事的话鲍比会打电话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby'll call if anything flares up on the Leviathan front.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.37,0:02:34.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与此同时  你知道你想做这个案子的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, you know you want to work this case, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.01,0:02:36.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电话里警察听起来好像手足无措\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cop on the wire sounded dumbfounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No arguments.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:39.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样很好  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of nice, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.82,0:02:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也该做点没劲的活儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're due for a little cut and dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.82,0:02:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.24,0:02:47.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少就我而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.07,0:02:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:53.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.26,0:02:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你并不想放她走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you didn't want to let her go,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.25,0:02:56.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但把她放走是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:57.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.17,0:02:58.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:13.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到疯狂镇  一人死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to crazytown, population -- one dead guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:14.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马修·哈蒙德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Matthew Hammond.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:20.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貌似是被撞死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems to have been crushed to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.73,0:03:21.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被什么撞死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}By?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这不是十楼的话  我会说是车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we weren't on the tenth floor, I'd say by a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:39.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,指针晃得好厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:41.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是鬼魂作怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.86,0:03:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还带着驾照\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a license?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:45.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《杀人执照》(一部老电影)\N{\fnArial\fs30}License to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.73,0:03:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有心情开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:54.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发现什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.22,0:03:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  像什么粉末\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Looks like some kind of powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:03:58.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,硫磺吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulfur?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:03:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  就是土\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Just dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.91,0:04:02.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be "Christine"-like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:05.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使被附身的车也不可能爬楼梯啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even possessed cars can't do stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:06.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是鬼一类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something spectral.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:10.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:12.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"戒酒十年"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"AA, 10 years."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.57,0:04:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死人  戒酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead and sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.51,0:04:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愈加怪异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double crappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有份固定的支出\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a charge keeps coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.15,0:04:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每月支付简之花五十美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 bucks a month at a place called Jane's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:24.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你  你去戒酒协会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congrats on your sobriety.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.34,0:04:26.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去调查简之花是什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go find out what Jane's is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为斋期我放弃戒酒协会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave up AA for lent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:31.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们又不是天主教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not catholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.94,0:04:33.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就一定要追根究底吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always with the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戒酒协会让我毛骨悚然\N{\fnArial\fs30}AA gives me the jeebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Shocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:38.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.23,0:04:41.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去调查戒酒协会  你去泡简\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hit the meeting. You go hit on Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.50,0:04:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马特是个好人  只是灵魂饱受折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt was a nice guy. Kind of a tortured soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.43,0:04:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加入了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:51.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他生活中似乎有很多烦心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he just seemed to have a lot going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:52.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道是什么事情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.93,0:04:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家人还是女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family, a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:56.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一直三缄其口\N{\fnArial\fs30}He played it all pretty close to the vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.41,0:04:59.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次见他的时候好像什么事情困扰着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something was eating at him, though, the last time I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.31,0:05:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他差点前功尽弃  -什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He almost slipped. - When?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想应该就在他死前吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just before he died, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他从尼尔的酒馆给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Called me from Neal's tavern.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.98,0:05:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说他差点就喝酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he was an inch away from drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.67,0:05:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跑过去  制止了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I ran over, talked him off the ledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:09.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你知道是什么造成的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do you know what triggered it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了  他不喜欢与人分享\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, he didn't share much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:20.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能帮你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:25.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要问你一些关于你客户的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had a few questions about a customer of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.54,0:05:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,客户名字是马修·哈蒙德\N{\fnArial\fs30}name of Matthew Hammond.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.93,0:05:29.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  他没惹麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sure. He's not in trouble, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.13,0:05:32.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  哈蒙德先生已经过世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, Mr. Hammond is no longer with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.55,0:05:35.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就说的通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it all makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:37.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么说的通\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几天前他来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came in, couple days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.10,0:05:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给了我三年的预付款以保证每月继续送花\N{\fnArial\fs30}paid me three years in advance to keep his monthly delivery going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花送去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do the flowers go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:45.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白·杜仑小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Miss Elizabeth Duren.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:48.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以将伊丽莎白的地址写下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind writing Elizabeth's address down?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去拜访她一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to pay her a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:05.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见一下伊丽莎白·杜仑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet Elizabeth Duren.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:10.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,享年十岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Died at 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那她究竟是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who was she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:15.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是回旅店再研究吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we chew on it back at the motel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白·杜仑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth Duren.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:26.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十年前被害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killed 10 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.29,0:06:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个邻居在车道上倒车的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When a neighbor backed out of his driveway,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.79,0:06:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没看到她在骑车\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't see her bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.08,0:06:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人遭到起诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one was ever charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.35,0:06:32.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-警方认定为交通意外  -让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Police ruled it an accident. - Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:34.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个邻居就是十楼上被撞成肉饼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The neighbor's our tenth-floor pancake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我们知道他为此很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we know he felt bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:38.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他送的花...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the flowers...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:39.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人不禁怀疑那家伙撞人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of makes you wonder if the guy wasn't drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有喝醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he ran her over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:44.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.89,0:06:47.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  不管怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, regardless,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.85,0:06:50.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼车事件总算有条靠谱的线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}now that we got a decent bead on ghost rider,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.69,0:06:51.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.05,0:06:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烧掉她的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn her bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让死者安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put her to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.07,0:07:00.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是没完没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fun never stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.27,0:07:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让那畜牲靠近我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep that thing away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.49,0:07:41.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是911  您有什么紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}911. What is your emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.02,0:07:48.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要帮助  有只狗在追我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need help. There's a dog after me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问您所在的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your address?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:50.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know! I'm --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.27,0:07:51.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道哪儿的一个餐馆里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some restaurant somewhere. I'm --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:53.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:55.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:56.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您在听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:07:59.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生  您能听到我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Sir? Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.55,0:08:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:06.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生  请您保持镇定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you need to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.19,0:08:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医务人员很快就能到  请说出您所在的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll send the paramedics. Just tell me where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.59,0:08:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生  您在听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir? Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又忙了个通宵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh, another night at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如你先去洗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take the first shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:19.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个名叫克里斯托弗·费舍的本地居民\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A local man, Christopher Fisher,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:24.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚遭到野生动物攻击  全身都被撕烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}was ripped to shreds in a wild-animal attack last night."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a dangerous world out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:30.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在一家餐馆的洗手间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in the restroom of a diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:32.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就不太对头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that doesn't sound right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.41,0:08:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面的顾客什么都没有看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, none of the patrons saw anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:37.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那人报了警  大喊什么有狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy calls 911, screaming about a dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:39.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是接线员什么都没有听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the operator didn't hear anything, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:43.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这家伙跟狗还有渊源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like this guy had a history with dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:47.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五年前  他因为组织斗狗活动遭到逮捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five years ago, he was arrested for running a dog-fighting operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.33,0:08:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.89,0:08:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢  他罪行累累\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? He causes so much misery
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.63,0:08:55.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一头罗特韦尔犬死而复生  找他报仇来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that some rottweiler goes cujo on him from beyond the grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:08:59.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  狗也变成鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Do... dogs even have ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:00.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头一回听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}First I've heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.69,0:09:02.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来好奇怪  鬼狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds weird. "Ghost dog"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:04.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是鬼车更诡异  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No weirder than "ghost car," you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:06.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说就通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what does make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.38,0:09:08.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,报复那个对你做迈克尔·维克(美国橄榄球球星)那一套的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vengeance on the guy that Michael Vick'd you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.38,0:09:08.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.27,0:09:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这人不喜欢说三道四\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm no one to judge,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我觉得这是那家伙自作自受\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it sounds to me like that guy had it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.77,0:09:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.51,0:09:15.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他被捕后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he got busted,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:18.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,判了缓刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}got probation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:19.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在一家动物收养所做志愿者\N{\fnArial\fs30}started volunteering at an animal shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.63,0:09:21.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  他非去不可  -最开始是被迫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Yeah, 'cause he had to. - At first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他刑满之后继续做了下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he kept going long after he served his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来他真心喜欢上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he got really into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.45,0:09:26.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还募集了很多捐款\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raised a lot of money for the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.97,0:09:27.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(流浪狗收养站感谢志愿者的帮助)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.23,0:09:29.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人是会变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People change.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:30.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话跟鬼狗说去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tell that to ghost dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:37.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  换衣服出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Uh, get suited up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:39.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去查验尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go check out the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.49,0:09:41.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -啥  啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:42.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.47,0:09:46.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peachy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.78,0:09:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行  去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:52.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜我有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, guess what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.63,0:09:54.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.34,0:09:55.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,指甲里面  鞋子上也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under his nails. On his shoes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.96,0:09:58.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-就跟车祸那儿的地板上一样  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just like the car-crash guy's floor? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:00.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说  他们应该都去过附近某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, gotta be someplace around here they both walked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苹果园\N{\fnArial\fs30}An apple farm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:06.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红土里面有某种东西能促进苹果生长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently whatever's in red dirt makes great apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.32,0:10:09.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我吃苹果  肯定会很感兴趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. I'd be so interested in that if I ate apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.52,0:10:12.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要找的苹果园应该很老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this one's supposed to be pretty old,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.35,0:10:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很可能荒废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}mostly abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.57,0:10:14.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有几百英亩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few hundred acres.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几百英亩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few hundred?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要找到猴年马月啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be searching all year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:31.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他刚刚跳到车前面  你说呢萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy just jumped in front of a car, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:35.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生  你需要帮助吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you want us to help you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.19,0:10:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  不如我们先带你离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, why don't we get you out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:40.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,免得你横死在马路上  行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you get roadkilled, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:49.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沃伦  你缓一缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Warren. Just, uh, take a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:50.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说说发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.69,0:10:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我看得出你们是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look -- you're good people, I can see that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.95,0:10:57.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你们帮不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can't do anything for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.76,0:10:58.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人能帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:10:59.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:00.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为超出了常理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause it's all impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不会相信我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't even believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.95,0:11:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, try us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.53,0:11:09.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚受过审判  被判死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just put on trial and sentenced to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.79,0:11:11.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打劫了一家酒水店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Held up a liquor store.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了老板和老板娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed the owner and his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.66,0:11:16.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是一时冲动  那时太年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't thinking. I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,年轻  什么时候的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young? When was this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.87,0:11:18.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1981年\N{\fnArial\fs30}1981.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.31,0:11:20.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在才审判你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they just put you on trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:22.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不  我刚刚出狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I just got out of prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.58,0:11:24.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了  你越说越没谱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you're making less sense the more you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:26.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  你继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's okay. Just...Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.65,0:11:29.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐了三十年牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚获得假释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got paroled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.34,0:11:33.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是并没有得到解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that you're ever free of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我每天都会想那件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think about it every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你先前在逃避什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, then, what were you running from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:40.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了  审判啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I told you -- the trial!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.45,0:11:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道  我刚刚还在酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is, one minute I'm at the bar,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.36,0:11:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着就被打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the next, I get jumped,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.86,0:11:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒来后就在这个该死的法庭里\N{\fnArial\fs30}wake up in a damn courtroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:48.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法庭  就是那种...法庭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Courtroom? Like a... courtroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.31,0:11:50.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  那儿只有一个法官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no. There was a judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:52.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.28,0:11:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是在一个谷仓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in a barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.47,0:11:54.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-在那个苹果农场吗  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- At the apple farm? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:11:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪个酒吧被掳走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this bar where you were grabbed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼尔酒馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neal's tavern.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和马修·哈蒙德在出车祸前去的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same place Matthew Hammond went before his...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是同一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得可能那个斗狗的人也去过那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think maybe dog guy went there, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有什么能告诉我们的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else you can tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:11.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.62,0:12:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是...专门研究疯狂的事情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kind of... specialize in crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.47,0:12:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那...这个法官  他有名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, this judge -- he got a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那里有些很怪异的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was these weird symbols.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:23.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,符号  你记得它们的样子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Symbols? Do you remember any of 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能画下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you draw them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.53,0:12:31.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:32.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能和你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:43.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谈什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:43.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"谈什么"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What is it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.68,0:12:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个是酒驾司机  一个是"迈克尔·维克"\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a drunk driver, Michael Vick,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.33,0:12:48.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30} a murderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.23,0:12:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候咱们这么是非不分了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}when did our black-and-white case turn to mud?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.70,0:12:53.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想说  在这件事上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying I'm having a hard time 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我实在没法不顶那些鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}not rooting for the ghosts on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你自己说过  这由不得我们去决断\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you said it yourself -- it's not on us to judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:13:00.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  只是那都是狗屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, except that that's complete crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.35,0:13:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家心里都有杆秤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody judges all day long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:04.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就应该无视那个家伙的所作所为吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm just supposed to ignore what that guy did?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:06.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也杀过人  迪恩  不止一两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've shot people, Dean -- more than two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:08.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  你知道吗  如果那些鬼魂来找我麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know what? When those ghosts come to kick my ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:09.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}they've got a compelling case.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你是要说什么  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you're saying -- what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再也不想干这活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to work the job anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.49,0:13:16.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望那天不这么复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}one simple friggin' day on the job --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:17.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这要求很过分吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that too much to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.68,0:13:21.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要出去一趟  试着找到那个谷仓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go out, I'm gonna go try and find that barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:24.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你一起吗  -我去酒吧看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You coming? - I'm gonna check the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:27.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是去干活还是喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}To work or drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.31,0:13:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没想好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:44.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  他上哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.09,0:13:48.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他...一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He... everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起回农场去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, let's go back to that farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.47,0:13:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不要  我不回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no. No, I'm not going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沃伦  我需要你帮我找到那间谷仓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warren, I need your help finding that barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它是红色的  非常显眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's red -- it stands out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不回去  他们就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going back. They're out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:58.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谁  -我杀的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - The people I killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:01.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...不  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just -- no. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟着我只会更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're safer with me than not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:06.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.26,0:14:09.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.69,0:14:16.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你在我回来之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to stay inside this circle
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:18.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都待在这圈子里  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}until I get back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.86,0:14:19.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它能保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.35,0:14:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我就好  好吗  我是在帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trust me, okay? I'm trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.31,0:14:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留在原地别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby? Hey. Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:38.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你发一些符号你帮我查查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen -- I'm sending you some symbols to look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.31,0:14:49.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.70,0:14:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚不醉不归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dive sweet dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在知道为什么大家都来这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now I know why everybody comes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:02.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I get ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:04.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,威士忌加苏打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotch and soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.54,0:15:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不加苏打了  我要一杯双份浓度的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, hold the soda. Make it a double.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.43,0:15:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...你都值夜班吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you -- you work the night shift?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.05,0:15:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问这干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.83,0:15:15.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打算来这儿做常客吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You plan on making this a regular thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:18.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我只是有几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just got a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.73,0:15:19.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你信不信  我是个警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it or not I'm a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:23.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.09,0:15:25.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来挺有沧桑感的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you've seen some crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.75,0:15:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  我有一个星期没上班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I was off all week,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:29.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过弗兰克明天会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Frank'll be back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:31.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.34,0:15:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do another.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:37.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是感情上的还是工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love life or job?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两杯双倍浓度一口闷  肯定有什么心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two quick doubles, it's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:41.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫蜜娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Mia, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蜜娅  这事不好说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mia, that is a complex question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:47.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  幸好我是个有着喝不完的酒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dean, luckily I'm like a captive shrink
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,着了迷的心理医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}with unlimited alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.89,0:15:52.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.87,0:15:56.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢倾听别人的麻烦事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like to hear people's problems, do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:15:57.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看人来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}On occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.12,0:16:05.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是工作上的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.63,0:16:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你问起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.81,0:16:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有不得不背着某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever do something behind someone's back
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.55,0:16:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做些事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you had to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.61,0:16:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得不好受吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you feel bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:20.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  如果你是逼不得已  为什么觉得愧疚呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dean, if you had to, why feel guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.80,0:16:22.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那没道理啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:30.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个话匣子要是打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, we don't have enough room for the worms
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.71,0:16:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这屋里都装不下\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we pop that can, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.27,0:16:36.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你慢点喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may want to slow your roll there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.83,0:16:38.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我酒量和小费成正比\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more I drink, the better I tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.16,0:16:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行  我还有一个小时下班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I'm off in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:41.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别在我面前醉倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't pass out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我想我该换啤酒喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I think I'll switch to beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.45,0:17:52.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比你找到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bobby, what do ya got?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些涂鸦的字体  是埃及文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those chicken scratches -- definitely egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.44,0:17:56.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出自《死亡之书》(古埃及随同墓葬的圣典)\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Book of the dead."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:17:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, good news, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:17:57.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:18:00.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有个奥西里斯(地狱判官)\N{\fnArial\fs30}They identify the God Osiris.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺独裁主义的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real authoritarian type.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:04.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他找上你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets ahold of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.49,0:18:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他当法官又当陪审团还负责执行死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's judge, jury, and executioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说他能直接看清人类的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lore says that he can see directly into the human heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.35,0:18:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他衡量愧疚感\N{\fnArial\fs30}He weighs the guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦他发现有一丁点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he finds more than a feather's worth --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.47,0:18:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}boom, you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:17.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他来迪尔伯恩干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's he doing in Dearborn?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.07,0:18:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来他总是突然出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it seems like he just pops up
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.56,0:18:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做他的巡回审判  然后再次消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}and does his circuit-judge act and then disappears again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.43,0:18:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只了解到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I got so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:25.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白这意味着什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this means.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:28.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白  必须在他再次消失之前找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We've got to find him before he goes underground again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.25,0:18:29.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你个傻孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you idjit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.46,0:18:32.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意味着你们两个得赶紧跑路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means you two got to get the hell out of dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:35.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙专盯自责愧疚的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy hones in on people who feel guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联想到谁了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who does that sound like to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都过去那么久了  别再难为自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while. But you owe yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是一阵小忧郁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing but a ground ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下包袱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got to put your mitt down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:49.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:18:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:07.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老哥  第三次留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, third message.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.95,0:19:08.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好别是喝高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better not be loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回电话  我有要事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me. This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:15.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  磨蹭什么呢  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. About time, man. I --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.62,0:19:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你好  -你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, hello? - Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.06,0:19:19.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从地上捡的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I picked this off the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:20.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这儿站了十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I've been standing for 10 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它响个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}listening to it ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:24.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是迪恩的手机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this Dean's phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:24.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:28.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说好在这等我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was supposed to meet me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.11,0:19:29.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪里  我马上过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you? I can be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.82,0:19:46.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.51,0:20:09.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  求求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.19,0:20:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.76,0:20:13.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你害了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:20.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hope he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:23.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪里发现手机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where exactly did you find this phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.99,0:20:26.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...There.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:28.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.47,0:21:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧沃伦  这么多东西你只注意到破符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Warren? All you noticed were the symbols?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.72,0:21:20.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别挣扎了  温彻斯特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit squirming, Mr. Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.41,0:21:22.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.41,0:21:22.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胡迪尼(逃逸术魔术师)也弄不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're Houdini-proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.35,0:21:26.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在说说你的指控  还是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you want to talk charges or...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.83,0:21:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想说说你在酒吧整的鬼把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather talk about your Bukowski schtick at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  清醒的不敢动  只敢偷袭醉汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you can't jump a guy when he's sober?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.00,0:21:33.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟那服务生聊得火热\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and that waitress had quite a talk, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:37.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝上几杯  心里的愧疚就全倒出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a couple drinks in you, and the guilt comes pouring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.85,0:21:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听墙根啊  真是厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, eavespropping -- that's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.05,0:21:40.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说到听墙根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.24,0:21:42.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就在那躲一晚上吗  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna skulk all night, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.64,0:21:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.01,0:21:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找人很快嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice job finding us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.93,0:21:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你也清楚我是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you figured out who I am, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.38,0:21:56.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.55,0:21:58.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不要给我讲讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to fill me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:02.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥西里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Osiris.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.20,0:22:04.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃及神祗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an egyptian god.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.96,0:22:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答对啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.57,0:22:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忙你的去吧  小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, go about your business, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.09,0:22:11.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人应该受审  那也是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if anyone should be on trial, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.11,0:22:13.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for me to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.58,0:22:14.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.88,0:22:16.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有权利请律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}But h-he has the right to an attorney...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.15,0:22:18.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.63,0:22:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-让我为他辩护  -这可不寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me defend him. - Well, that's unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.43,0:22:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底尊不尊重他的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna respect his rights or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.44,0:22:26.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有何不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.87,0:22:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你不是律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Sam? You're not a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.54,0:22:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我读过法律预科\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was pre-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:34.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是预科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, pre.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.86,0:22:36.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then. Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.57,0:22:40.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要传唤的证人那是多得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the list of witnesses I can call --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.26,0:22:42.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-数都数不清  -反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- endless. - Objection!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.83,0:22:44.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还要不要我把话说完  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna let me finish my sentence, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.61,0:22:46.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.85,0:22:48.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"公平"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fair"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.59,0:22:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.00,0:22:51.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.68,0:22:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此事可以从简\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make it very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:22:57.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三名证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.91,0:22:59.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-反对  -为何\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Objection! - Grounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.39,0:23:01.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传唤证人未经事先告知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness is being called without prior notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:03.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-说得好  -《傲骨贤妻》里学来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good one. - I saw that on "The good wife."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.89,0:23:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  反对合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Very fine objection.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.70,0:23:07.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驳回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denied!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.63,0:23:08.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.87,0:23:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是法官呀  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm the judge, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.59,0:23:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再反对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now stop objecting,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.67,0:23:16.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我判你藐视法庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'll find you in contempt --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.00,0:23:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将你杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.62,0:23:23.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我建议你让我继续审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I advise you to let me move it along.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.06,0:23:27.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法庭传唤证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prosecution calls
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.33,0:23:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔安娜·贝丝·哈维尔出庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joanna Beth Harvelle to the stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:37.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.46,0:23:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.51,0:23:47.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的姓名\N{\fnArial\fs30}State your name for the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.46,0:23:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔·哈维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo Harvelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.51,0:23:54.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你与迪恩·温彻斯特是什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what is your relationship to Dean Winchester?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.93,0:23:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We worked together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.19,0:24:07.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是很仰慕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it true that you admired him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.94,0:24:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为猎魔人  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as a hunter... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.46,0:24:15.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单就男人来说  他有些可恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a guy, he was kind of a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.24,0:24:18.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你将他视为导师吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you saw him as a mentor of sorts?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.85,0:24:20.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想这样形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't put it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.16,0:24:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为是怎样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.96,0:24:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.23,0:24:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我信任他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trusted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.79,0:24:28.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以如果你是想证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you're trying to say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.02,0:24:29.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个坏人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he was a bad guy or something...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.55,0:24:30.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.15,0:24:31.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.45,0:24:34.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与他并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.32,0:24:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考虑到你的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.73,0:24:38.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不难  什么感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. What feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.34,0:24:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了他你什么都愿意做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have done quite a bit for him...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.11,0:24:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么关都敢闯\N{\fnArial\fs30}followed him into any battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.32,0:24:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你想说什么  一派胡言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're getting at, and it's bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.05,0:24:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么让你从此走向不归路的第一次猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Dean had nothing to do with your first case,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.66,0:24:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与迪恩毫无关系咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one that started it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.73,0:25:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.80,0:25:04.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有感情  一丁点儿也没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No feelings. None at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.48,0:25:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还会选择同样的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have chosen the same exact road.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.49,0:25:13.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死在那间五金店里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ended up in that hardware store,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.25,0:25:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手里拿着引爆器\N{\fnArial\fs30}holding the fuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.37,0:25:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真是有才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're a piece of work. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.41,0:25:19.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一句一句引着她说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting words in her mouth --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.25,0:25:22.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辩护律师  管好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep him under control, counsel...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.79,0:25:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我拔了他的舌头\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'll remove his tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.99,0:25:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该你提问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.77,0:25:38.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.95,0:25:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲跟你们一起生活过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad... was in the life?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.16,0:25:49.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.91,0:25:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和他关系如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your relationship with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.51,0:25:52.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.74,0:25:53.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.54,0:25:54.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你崇拜他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You idolized him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.52,0:25:56.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.50,0:25:57.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你从猎的初衷\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why'd you start, 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.41,0:26:00.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为了让一个你刚认识的多嘴之徒刮目相看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}to impress some loudmouth ass you just met...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.75,0:26:03.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是为追随你父亲的脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}or 'cause you wanted to be like your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.19,0:26:05.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恋父情结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.92,0:26:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.77,0:26:09.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  迪恩  我不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Dean, I don't --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.36,0:26:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.24,0:26:17.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩可以先商讨下策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two can have a moment to strategize.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.38,0:26:23.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我再传唤下一位证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I'll call my next witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.40,0:26:31.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一个证人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Who's the next witness?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.48,0:26:33.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他看你的样子好像你会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looked at you like you'd know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.98,0:26:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点儿头绪都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.58,0:26:36.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这整件事就像是在上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing's like a friggin' episode
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.71,0:26:37.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《皮·威电视剧场》(儿童娱乐片)\N{\fnArial\fs30}of "Pee-wee's Playhouse".
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.71,0:26:37.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.04,0:26:39.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传下一位证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next witness!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.02,0:26:41.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原告传唤...\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prosecution calls...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.22,0:26:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆·温彻斯特出庭作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester to the stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.89,0:26:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.54,0:26:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的生活并非你所期待的  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly the life you expected, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.88,0:26:55.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍有不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Details a little different.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.47,0:26:58.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾几何时  你本可以成为一名真正的律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a while there, you were gonna be a real lawyer,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.03,0:27:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迎娶杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}marry Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.17,0:27:01.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  很久以前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.61,0:27:05.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你是否曾退出家族事业  并过得很幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}But were you or were you not happily out of the family racket
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.99,0:27:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到迪恩开着那辆吃油车又回到你的生活里\N{\fnArial\fs30}until Dean showed back up in that gas guzzler?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.42,0:27:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在只能说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah-ah. The truth, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.02,0:27:22.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一言难尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.23,0:27:27.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个举动却引发了一场多米诺骨牌效应\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one act had quite a domino effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.09,0:27:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到之前话题  你的女友命丧黄泉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back, your girl's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.14,0:27:31.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不是他造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that wasn't his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.18,0:27:34.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  接下来的一切也都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, and neither is everything that came after --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.48,0:27:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的牺牲  流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the death and the blood
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.15,0:27:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及各种命悬一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hanging on by a thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.58,0:27:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都和迪恩没有直接的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of that is on Dean, directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.69,0:28:04.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但难道你没想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't you think
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.86,0:28:08.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥将你拖入这灾难性的烂摊子中\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your brother dragged you back into that catastrophic mess
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.20,0:28:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为他宁愿拖你下水  也不愿独自承受吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he'd rather damn you with him than be alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.89,0:28:20.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.02,0:28:22.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样  我都会牵扯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way or another, I'd have gotten pulled back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.54,0:28:24.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你确定吗  -非常确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know that for certain? - Pretty sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.39,0:28:26.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-"非常确定"  -我肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Pretty sure"? - I'm positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.02,0:28:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.27,0:28:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是要说服我  我会说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, if it was about convincing me I would say...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.46,0:28:32.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.08,0:28:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都决定不了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't decide anything, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.38,0:28:39.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无权决定迪恩的罪责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't decide Dean's guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.53,0:28:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是权衡已有的罪责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just weigh the guilt that's already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.11,0:28:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这仅关乎迪恩的个人感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is solely about how Dean feels,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.65,0:28:49.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}way down deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.36,0:28:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那才是突破点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them's the breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.56,0:28:59.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么如果迪恩认为自己无罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if Dean believes he's innocent,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.01,0:29:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就无罪对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.60,0:29:01.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"如果"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If".
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.86,0:29:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很重要的前提\N{\fnArial\fs30}A big "If".
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.21,0:29:05.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为何要重提旧事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I bring up the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.37,0:29:11.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是要看他是否依旧执念\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see if he feels like dog food about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.45,0:29:13.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们渴求接受批判\N{\fnArial\fs30}People want to be judged.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.56,0:29:14.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}They really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.41,0:29:17.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你心已满负罪责  我来告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your heart's heavy, let me tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.38,0:29:20.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正的惩罚是释然的良药\N{\fnArial\fs30}real punishment's a mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.28,0:29:22.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想传唤迪恩出庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to call Dean to the stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.05,0:29:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you do, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.19,0:29:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这种东西总讲究个先来后到\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is an order to this stuff, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.77,0:29:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那行  我允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.16,0:29:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.66,0:29:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来找我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you came and got me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.05,0:29:47.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道杰西会死去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you know Jess would die?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.56,0:29:48.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者其他任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or any of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.65,0:29:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-当然不知道  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 'course not. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.27,0:29:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能呢  难道你能通灵吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you? I mean, are you psychic?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.02,0:29:55.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个需要回答的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.65,0:29:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.19,0:29:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-当然不能通灵  -很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, definitely not psychic. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.04,0:30:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么为何要因无法预测未来而  而自责呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why would you feel guilty about not predicting the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.57,0:30:05.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  这确实说不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess that doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.41,0:30:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  没错  不  我没罪恶感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, yeah, no, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.14,0:30:09.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那乔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Jo?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.79,0:30:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你杀死了她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you actually kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.48,0:30:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.10,0:30:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说吧  你对她并无内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it true that you don't feel guilty about her --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.48,0:30:19.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而只是...对她的死感到难过  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're just...sad she's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.54,0:30:22.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是感觉这...糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it just...blows?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.12,0:30:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.40,0:30:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.09,0:30:32.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺有范的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your style, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.83,0:30:33.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分有魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very engaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.06,0:30:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.33,0:30:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有这些  你都真的感觉责任在你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}does any of this feel like it's really...on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.54,0:30:42.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不尽然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.93,0:30:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你是内心背负了罪恶感而沉重无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then is your heart heavy with guilt
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.00,0:30:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是只是沉重而已  与这家伙无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}or just plain heavy and none of this guy's business?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.45,0:30:53.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的...后者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what you said -- the second thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.04,0:30:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I rest my case.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.40,0:30:58.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常棒...你们都很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good... Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.88,0:30:59.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.00,0:31:02.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确实欣赏了一出好戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I really enjoyed that,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.24,0:31:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为回报  我想征询你的意见...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be generous and ask --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.59,0:31:08.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你希望我传唤最后一位证人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, do you want me to call my last witness?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.58,0:31:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你并不想放她走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you didn't want to let her go,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.78,0:31:14.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但把她放走是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.96,0:31:15.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.04,0:31:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者就到此为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or have we had enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.35,0:31:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他究竟在说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.55,0:31:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《甜心俏佳人》(女性为主的温馨律政剧)扮够了吧  一锤定音吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough Ally McBealing. Just drop the hammer, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.55,0:31:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.93,0:31:28.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.43,0:31:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在给我们时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's giving us more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.30,0:31:30.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会有什么改变的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna make a difference, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.51,0:31:32.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还需要讨论会吗  还是已经好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need another moment? You done?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.01,0:31:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法庭已达成一致裁判\N{\fnArial\fs30}The court's reached a verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.22,0:31:51.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩·温彻斯特被叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find you, Dean Winchester,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.00,0:31:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心负罪责...\N{\fnArial\fs30}guilty in your heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.59,0:31:56.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并处以死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sentence you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.08,0:32:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我建议你尽快处理后事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd suggest you get your affairs in order quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.79,0:32:32.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  我告诉过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, I told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.58,0:32:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥西里斯怎么着都会找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Osiris would have got to him one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.03,0:32:38.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙实在厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy's batting a thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.10,0:32:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有时间  我们能想出办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still time. We can figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.64,0:32:58.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.43,0:32:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你查到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.26,0:33:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能让奥西里斯翘辫子的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}A way to give Osiris a dirt nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.37,0:33:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  我们急需\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. We need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.22,0:33:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, as near as I can figure,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.75,0:33:07.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少能让他沉睡两个世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}it ought to put him down for a couple of centuries, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.54,0:33:09.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从法老强势后这方法还奏效过好几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worked a few times since the pharaohs were big.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.18,0:33:11.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说这只是暂时的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's temporary?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.36,0:33:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很长的暂时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.79,0:33:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说咱们不如先这么凑合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we slap that band-aid on
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.51,0:33:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后跑去向外星猎人寻求彻底解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave finding a cure to some hunter in a space suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.83,0:33:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得用公羊角捅他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you're gonna need to stab him with a ram's horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.99,0:33:21.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公羊角\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ram's horn?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.94,0:33:23.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪尔伯恩哪来的公羊角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I gonna find a ram's horn in dearborn?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.09,0:33:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.27,0:33:27.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那玩意一定要锋利\N{\fnArial\fs30}But make sure it's a sharp piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.22,0:33:28.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可不会给你第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't gonna let you stab him twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.97,0:33:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.52,0:33:31.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公羊角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ram's horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.80,0:33:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.86,0:33:41.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来  犹太人每年都会吹响它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, jewish people blow through them once a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.22,0:33:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么晚了你上哪去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you gonna find one this time of night?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.45,0:33:47.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犹太教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Synagogue?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.41,0:33:48.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要从教堂偷一个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna steal from a temple?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.28,0:33:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又打破下线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a new low.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.43,0:33:51.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在是死囚  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on death row, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.68,0:33:52.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别嘻嘻哈哈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit joking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.85,0:33:54.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙拿来  我去去就回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Keys. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.12,0:33:57.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那混蛋会派乔来对付我  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dick's gonna sent jo after me, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.72,0:33:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个猎手  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hunter, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.77,0:33:59.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道怎么对付鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how to deal with ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.97,0:34:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是要我再杀她一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you suggesting I kill her again?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.35,0:34:09.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没杀过她  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't kill her, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.66,0:34:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我快去快回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.81,0:34:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.46,0:35:01.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你不是来接受戒礼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing you're not here for bar mitzvah lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.97,0:35:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'd never do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.99,0:35:17.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.02,0:35:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这是他的怪癖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it's his thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.60,0:35:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扭曲的以眼还眼什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of twisted eye for an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.41,0:35:28.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.44,0:35:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.99,0:35:32.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你命不该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserve better.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.95,0:35:33.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.36,0:35:36.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你命不该如此  乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserved better, jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.07,0:35:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我过得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, my life was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.87,0:35:53.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.46,0:35:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was right, you know --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.49,0:35:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那混蛋法官  关于我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That dick judge, about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.19,0:36:00.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.55,0:36:01.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.43,0:36:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.87,0:36:05.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.01,0:36:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是  你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just -- you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.78,0:36:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎人没有童年\N{\fnArial\fs30}hunters are never kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.13,0:36:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never was.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.40,0:36:14.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至想都没想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even stop to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.68,0:36:16.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的错  那不是你的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault. It wasn't on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.91,0:36:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不想独自承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I didn't want to do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.96,0:36:20.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁想呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who does?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.46,0:36:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本该\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the right thing
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.22,0:36:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送你回你妈那里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}would have been to send your ass back home to your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.58,0:36:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好像你能做到似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like to have seen you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.32,0:36:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他倒是说对了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was right about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.21,0:36:34.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪件  你爱上我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, your massive crush on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.94,0:36:35.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.09,0:36:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肩负了太多不必要的烂摊子  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You carry all kinds of crap you don't have to, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.50,0:36:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死后我看得更明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It kind of gets clearer when you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.77,0:36:52.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.90,0:36:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该能看到我心里有九成烂事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should be able to see that I am 90%... crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.47,0:37:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我摆脱掉那些又能怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get rid of that, what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.01,0:37:05.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真想不去探究一下就死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want to die not knowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.74,0:37:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.67,0:37:13.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.82,0:37:14.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.49,0:37:50.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别傻了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.59,0:37:52.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猎杀过鬼魂  我知道那点花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to hunt ghosts. I know the tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.78,0:38:12.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他逼我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's making me do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.20,0:38:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.95,0:39:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.72,0:39:20.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说  她看起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it seem like... You know, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.64,0:39:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她看起来痛苦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was in pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.68,0:39:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.18,0:39:27.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是有点苍白  乔平时的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just kind of faded. Regular jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.01,0:39:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  可能更快乐了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, maybe a little happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.75,0:39:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.29,0:39:37.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where the hell did that come from,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.10,0:39:40.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请愿为我辩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}volunteering to defend me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.70,0:39:41.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要赶我走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was gonna kick me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.83,0:39:44.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不准  在另一种人生中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man -- in another life,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.22,0:39:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能当个不错的金装混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might have made a pretty decent scuzzbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.64,0:39:48.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是第一次  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm 0 for 1, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.97,0:39:50.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.32,0:39:52.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你挺有说服力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were pretty convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.58,0:39:55.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说的是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who was he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.97,0:39:56.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.69,0:39:58.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那什么最后的证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That whole final-witness thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.67,0:40:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.66,0:40:04.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是任何一个因我们而死的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, that could be just about anybody dead we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.84,0:40:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.51,0:40:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道为什么法官大人要审判我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I get why judge judy put me on trial --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.40,0:40:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我浑身透着罪过的气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got guilt coming out of my pores.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.65,0:40:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是为什么他不审你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...Why'd he skip you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.93,0:40:24.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想  可能是我不再感到内疚了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I just don't... Feel guilty anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.64,0:40:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看  我不知道怎么和你形容  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know what to tell you, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.38,0:40:29.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很长一段时间都感觉很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've spent a lot of time feeling pretty crappy --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.74,0:40:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貌似是一生的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.90,0:40:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你私藏幸福药了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you got a secret stash of happy pills?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.46,0:40:36.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.17,0:40:38.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能这很荒唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not saying it's logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.65,0:40:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是  我觉得我做了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...You know, I feel like I did a lot of stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.26,0:40:43.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该为之愧疚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have felt bad for,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.21,0:40:45.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我又偿还了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I paid a lot of dues
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.49,0:40:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不再欠这个债了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and came out the other side, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.96,0:40:47.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that worked?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.93,0:40:49.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉你是一笔勾销了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you really feel like your slate's wiped?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.30,0:40:51.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.01,0:40:53.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能会一笔勾销的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing ever gets wiped. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.54,0:40:56.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时我在刷牙的时候会看到路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I see lucifer when I friggin' brush my teeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.86,0:40:58.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  我终于觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, I don't know, I guess I just finally feel like
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.70,0:41:01.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去的就过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}my past is my past,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.14,0:41:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能继续过我的生活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can move on with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.03,0:41:05.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, hopefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.77,0:41:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得容易做的难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.06,0:41:07.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not arguing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.06,0:41:15.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道是要嫉妒还是觉得诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know whether to be jealous or weirded out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.73,0:41:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会习惯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.61,0:41:19.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想听起来很差劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't want to sound lame,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.80,0:41:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我感觉很爽  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}but...I kind of feel good, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.40,0:41:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正跟你一起会开心就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you are going to be a pleasure to ride with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
